{"availability":"available","full":"nirholas/hookforge","name":"hookforge","description":"50 production Uniswap v4 hooks: novel AMM mechanisms, Solidity + Foundry, a TypeScript SDK, an MCP server for agents, and a 3D docs site. Base, Arbitrum, Unichain, Robinhood Chain.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Solidity","stars":5,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-07T01:17:12Z","updated":"2026-10-10T22:16:48Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hookforge.pages.dev/","topics":["agents-md","ai-agents","ethereum","llms-txt","model-context-protocol","open-source","solidity","three-ws","threejs"],"demo":"https://hookforge.pages.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:47:06.750Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:47:06.750Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:47:06.750Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T16:23:39.867Z","stars":5,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T16:42:27.287Z","stars":5,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T02:10:18.721Z","stars":5,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T02:47:06.750Z","stars":5,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["50 production Uniswap v4 hooks that do not exist yet.","Uniswap v4 turned the AMM into a platform, and most of what has been built on it so far is a re-implementation of something that already worked: limit orders, TWAMM, KYC gates, another dynamic fee. HookForge is a catalogue of the mechanisms that are missing. Every hook here is checked against the 140 published hooks and hackathon submissions before it is written, each one ships with its prior art stated in the source, and each one is a complete contract with tests, a deployment script, a TypeScript client and a page in the docs.","Nothing here is a sketch. There are no mocks, no TODOs and no stubs. If a hook is listed as shipped, it compiles, its tests pass against a real PoolManager, and it can be deployed with one command."],"features":["Chains: Base, Arbitrum One, Unichain, Robinhood Chain, and any EVM chain with a v4 PoolManager.","Built on: Uniswap v4-core and OpenZeppelin's audited","Licence: Apache-2.0."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/hookforge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f2acde544d762eaac22136761ff5bc67192d2ef4a68a9a3c9ee38a5402890068","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:25:25.239Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:25:25.239Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"50 production Uniswap v4 hooks that do not exist yet.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/hookforge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f2acde544d762eaac22136761ff5bc67192d2ef4a68a9a3c9ee38a5402890068","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/hookforge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:25:25.239Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T16:15:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/hookforge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:25:25.240Z","hash":"f2acde544d762eaac22136761ff5bc67192d2ef4a68a9a3c9ee38a5402890068","originalBytes":15070,"storedBytes":15070,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T16:23:39.867Z","subjects":["Crypto & blockchain","MCP servers & agents","3D & graphics"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["Crypto & blockchain","MCP servers & agents","3D & graphics"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Crypto & blockchain","source":"metadata","match":"Solidity"},{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"MCP"},{"subject":"3D & graphics","source":"metadata","match":"3D"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Maths & algorithms"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://hookforge.pages.dev/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T02:36:13.046Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T02:36:13.046Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-13T02:36:13.046Z","target":"https://hookforge